QUICK REVISION TABLE
================================================================================

+----------------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| CONCEPT              | REMEMBER                                      |
+----------------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| useState             | Manages local component state                 |
| State Value          | Current value for this render                  |
| State Setter         | Requests next state                           |
