================================================================================
WRONG VS RIGHT - FINAL REVISION
================================================================================

+----------------------+--------------------------+-----------------------------+
| OPERATION            | WRONG                    | RIGHT                       |
+----------------------+--------------------------+-----------------------------+
| Counter update       | count++                  | setCount(prev => prev + 1) |
| Object property      | user.name = value        | setUser({...user, ...})     |
| Add array item       | items.push(item)         | setItems([...items, item])  |
| Remove array item    | items.splice(...)        | setItems(items.filter(...)) |
| Update array item    | item.done = true         | setItems(items.map(...))    |
| Toggle boolean       | flag = !flag             | setFlag(prev => !prev)      |
| Sort state array     | items.sort()             | [...items].sort()           |
| Nested property      | obj.a.b = value          | Copy outer + nested object  |
